 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And Kottarakkara?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Some absences speak louder than presence.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The Thekkumkur Raja counts Dutch masts and waits to see which way the wind blows.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Savitri in Kottarakkara writes letters to Velinadu asking whether this is the moment.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "She is watching too.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Watching to see whether her king is worth her kinswoman's silence.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You will not take the vines on that ridge. If the Dutch burn the lower fields, we will still have pepper to sell them at higher prices when they crawl back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "HEADMAN"
   ],
   "text": "Always thinking of profit, Amma.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Profit is survival written in accounts.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (small)"
   ],
   "text": "The walls will hold.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (smaller)"
   ],
   "text": "If the men do.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Fear is heavy enough without empty stomachs.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You will ride from here in the morning. Your horses will leave hoofprints in my yard. Do not waste them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I will try not to trample anything you wish to keep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The sea and the Dutch will trample more than you ever could.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Just make sure that when they do, they taste sand with it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "Tomorrow we do not have the luxury of turning when we please. They will fire when it suits them, not us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then make the sand your ally before their powder speaks.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You and your men read this beach better than any Deccan rider.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "nagoji",
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PONNAN"
   ],
   "text": "If we live through this, Sawant, I will decide whether to be flattered.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ponnan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You do not have to kill every Dutchman to win. You have to break their line, their nerve.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "madurai_troop",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If you survive one volley and reach them still moving, half their courage will die before any man does.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "kayal",
    "madurai_troop",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAZA KHAN"
   ],
   "text": "We have fought men with guns before. But we have not fought men who think their God has given them all the guns that matter.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then we teach their God some humility.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "raza"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You have seen their ships now. Do they look like gods?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "YOUNG NAIR"
   ],
   "text": "They look like houses turned on their sides.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "YOUNG NAIR"
   ],
   "text": "With too many sticks.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And the men on them?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SECOND NAIR"
   ],
   "text": "They look like men. Too pale. Too stiff.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Remember that when they fire.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Their powder burns the same. Their blood spills the same.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Their screams sound the same when steel touches them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They are here because their books are bleeding.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They are angry that we refuse their contracts and sell instead through men like Tharakan here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "THARAKAN"
   ],
   "text": "Their anger is cheaper than their pepper, Your Highness. Let them keep it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "They are overconfident. And they are alone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch are fighting their own fires in the east. What sits on that beach is all they have.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "THARAKAN"
   ],
   "text": "Van Imhoff meant to strangle the chumkam, the crown's share of every bag of pepper that leaves this coast. No treasury, no army.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "A sailor's strategy. But he forgets that pepper has legs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "mathoo",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (voice-over)"
   ],
   "text": "The Dutch can blockade our harbours until their ships rot, but they cannot stop a bullock cart.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (memory)"
   ],
   "text": "They sold prisoners as slaves. Twelve and a half rixdollars for anyone over fourteen.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN (memory)"
   ],
   "text": "Twenty for a Nair, because Nairs are worth more to the Batavia markets.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KARL AUGUST (memory)"
   ],
   "text": "Their engineer builds today, demolishes tomorrow. When they put nine cannons on the walls, the weight made them collapse.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": [
    "karl"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "KARL AUGUST (memory)"
   ],
   "text": "Hackert, their commander, left. He took most of the ships, the rice, the gunpowder. He left a lieutenant named Rijtel with two hundred and fifty Europeans.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "KARL AUGUST (memory)"
   ],
   "text": "They have provisions for days, not weeks.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Desinganadu promised to fight us, then stopped his campaign because of a festival. A festival.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Coalitions built on Dutch coin fall apart when the coin stops flowing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If we charge them...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "No charge. Not yet.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We do not spend men to prove we are brave. We spend them to win.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We pin them. Block the inland road. Force them back onto the sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "A siege? On an open beach?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "A prison without walls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (voice-over)"
   ],
   "text": "And the sea?",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (voice-over)"
   ],
   "text": "At night, the sea will belong to the fishermen, not the Dutch ships.",
   "tail": "no tail (tailless box)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Your horsemen will not charge a line, Nagoji. You will be the bars of the cage.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Capture their scouts. Cut off their foraging parties.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Once they step onto that beach, they never step off it unless in chains.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We will starve them. And bleed them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We will break them. Slowly. Until they realise that their monopoly is worth less than their lives.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "The sea does not care whose name you call when it takes you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Best to have several listening.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "You think they pray on those ships?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "They pray to their god and their profit. I do not know which they trust more.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "We will find out tomorrow.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You ever think you would be here, sahib? About to ride at Dutch guns for a king who is not yours?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "The gods have poor handwriting.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If they wrote this in my horoscope, the astrologer must have fallen asleep.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "The men trust you. When you say \"ride\", they will.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That is what frightens me.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You are not afraid of Dutch guns?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-15-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Guns I understand. Men who follow because they believe you see further than they do, that is a weight I am still learning how to carry.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You carried it on the Godavari.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "You carried it when you chose to jump from that ship and leave a boy behind rather than let both of you drown for nothing. Do not pretend this is new.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-16-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It feels different here. There, we rode for hills we knew.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "keshavrao",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Here, I ride for a king I have known a short while, on land whose gods I do not fully understand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI"
   ],
   "text": "The bullets will not stop to ask whose gods you prayed to. You ride for the man you chose when you did not run north.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "dhanaji",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You men speak of guns and gods. But there are older powers to reckon with before the sun rises.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Come, Nagoji. There is one place you must visit.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "This is the Sarpa Kavu.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-17-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The Abode of Snakes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "It is a secret place. Only the immediate family of Padmini Amma's tharavadu may walk here freely.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "To bring a stranger is to ask the Naga Rajas to witness him.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He rides for us. He needs their permission to bleed on their earth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Before there were kings in Padmanabhapuram, before the Dutch sailed their wooden islands, this grove was here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "We let the Nagas rule this darkness so that they might let us rule the light.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "We ask for their blessing. Not for glory, but for venom.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-18-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "The stillness that strikes.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "There is a moment, before every great event, when the land holds its breath.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "This is that moment. The Naga lords are listening.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not shout our war cries here. We endure. We bend until men think we will break, then we stand up again.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "That is the lesson of the snake.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Pray, Nagoji. Ask that your strike be true.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (unsteady)"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Now go.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-19-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (unsteady)"
   ],
   "text": "Sleep if you can.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "If I survive, we will have a conversation about queens and guests.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "But not tonight.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "You do not get to die cheaply now. Not with unfinished words between us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Then I will try to live expensively.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "DHANAJI (off, distant)"
   ],
   "text": "Nagoji?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": []
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "And Nagoji... if you die tomorrow, die facing the right direction.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI"
   ],
   "text": "Do not give the Dutch the satisfaction of seeing your back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-20-panel-06",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "REVATHI (whisper)"
   ],
   "text": "And if you live, do not make me a widow for a king I did not choose.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "revathi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-21-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The dawn will not wait. Rest now.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini",
    "revathi"
   ]
  }
 ]
}